起，亦有民變发生，新朝僅14年就被推翻，王莽也被叛軍所殺。文獻記載王莽身高七尺五寸（大約173公分）。他終其一生都自奉甚儉、治家嚴苛，曾先後命三名行為不端的嫡子自盡。","link_td_id":"Q10008016","link_td_number_id":16053,"people_name":"莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"莽","people_xingming":"王莽","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"93201acd-db0e-11ef-ac44-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周歆","people_name_jianti_auto":"周歆","people_xingming":"周歆","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"93201ace-db0e-11ef-a9e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"邯，西汉末新朝初句町国（今云南省广南县）王。","link_td_id":"Q10016934","link_td_number_id":4440598,"people_name":"邯","people_name_jianti_auto":"邯","people_xingming":"邯","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"93201acf-db0e-11ef-8857-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"邯，西汉末新朝初句町国（今云南省广南县）王。","link_td_id":"Q10016934","link_td_number_id":4440598,"people_name":"邯","people_name_jianti_auto":"邯","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"93203a21-db0e-11ef-ba39-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"承","people_name_jianti_auto":"承","people_xingming":"承","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"93203a22-db0e-11ef-91c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"歆","people_name_jianti_auto":"歆","people_xingming":"周歆","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"93203a23-db0e-11ef-994c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-45,"link_death_year":23,"link_td_description":"王莽，字巨君，魏郡元城貴鄉（今河北邯郸大名縣東）人，篡夺汉朝自立，不被承认的僭主，是西漢末年政治人物、外戚及權臣。他最終以「假皇帝」（代理皇帝）身份登基並建立新朝，自称“皇帝”。稱帝後的王莽大舉推行向周朝看齊的復古改革，引發社會動盪，再加上黃河改道等天災，以致各地豪強紛起，亦有民變发生，新朝僅14年就被推翻，王莽也被叛軍所殺。文獻記載王莽身高七尺五寸（大約173公分）。他終其一生都自奉甚儉、治家嚴苛，曾先後命三名行為不端的嫡子自盡。","link_td_id":"Q10008016","link_td_number_id":16053,"people_name":"莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"莽","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"93203a24-db0e-11ef-b39a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田譚","people_name_jianti_auto":"田谭","people_xingming":"田谭","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"93203a28-db0e-11ef-b608-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高句驪侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"高句骊侯","people_xingming":"null","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"93203a29-db0e-11ef-a03e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"騶","people_name_jianti_auto":"驺","people_xingming":"驺","star